B.af5=new A.h8("What is SamadhanAI?","SamadhanAI is a digital service for submitting civic grievances and viewing the status information available in your account. This website also explains the service and app availability.",null,null)
B.af1=new A.h8("Should I enter passwords, OTPs, or API keys here?","No. Never share passwords, one-time codes, API keys, access tokens, payment details, or login credentials in this help panel. SamadhanAI staff will not ask you to disclose those secrets here.",null,null)
B.af0=new A.h8("How do I report a civic issue?","Choose \u201cReport an Issue\u201d or \u201cReport a civic issue\u201d and sign in or create an account. Select a category, describe the issue, and add a location or relevant photos if useful.","/register","Report an issue")
B.aeZ=new A.h8("What details should I include?","Add a clear description, the place where the issue is happening, and relevant evidence if you have it. Share only information needed to explain the issue; avoid posting passwords, identity documents, or other private details.",null,null)
B.afa=new A.h8("How do I track a report?","Sign in and open My Grievances to see status information recorded for your reports. Updates depend on the service and authorized workflow.","/login","Sign in to track")
B.af3=new A.h8(u.n,"Not necessarily. Department assignment and delivery depend on the configured services and authorized workflows. SamadhanAI does not promise that every report is automatically sent to a government department.",null,null)
B.af9=new A.h8("When will I get a response or status update?","The website cannot promise a response time. Check your account for updates that are available. For an urgent issue, contact the responsible local authority directly.",null,null)
B.af4=new A.h8("Does SamadhanAI use AI?","When the AI service is configured and available, it may help classify a complaint or suggest wording. Review any suggestion yourself. AI output is not an official decision or a guarantee.",null,null)
B.af6=new A.h8("Can this help chat access my account or report?","No. This is a preset FAQ. It cannot sign in, look up reports, view personal data, or send messages to the application or an AI service.",null,null)
B.aeY=new A.h8("What happens to the questions I select?","The answers are built into this website. Selecting a question stays in your browser; this help panel does not send or save your chat selections.",null,null)
B.af2=new A.h8("Is the Android app available?","The Download App page shows the current release status. Download links are enabled only when a verified Android release is configured.","/download","View app status")
B.af_=new A.h8("Is an iPhone app available?","iOS availability has not been verified. Check the Download App page for the current platform status.","/download","View app status")
B.af7=new A.h8("What should I do in an emergency?","Do not rely on a grievance report for immediate help. Contact your local emergency service or responsible authority directly.",null,null)
B.af8=new A.h8("Can staff retrieve my password or API credentials?","No. This help panel does not handle credentials or private account data. Use the sign-in page\u2019s account recovery options if you cannot access your account.","/login","Open sign in")
