B.a1e=new A.an("What kinds of issues can I report?","You can describe a local public-service issue in the application. Available categories and any suggested department depend on the configured services and information you provide.")
B.a0T=new A.an("How can I follow my grievance?","After signing in, use My Grievances to view submitted cases and the status information available for each one.")
B.a0Y=new A.an("How does AI assist with grievance management?","When the AI service is configured and available, it can help classify a complaint, suggest wording, or analyze submitted details. Review suggestions before submitting; AI output is not a decision or guarantee.")
